<title>USA: Food Lion, ABC jury begins deliberations.</title>
<headline>Food Lion, ABC jury begins deliberations.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The federal jury in Food Lion Inc's fraud lawsuit trial against Walt Disney Co's ABC television began its deliberations at 1525 EST/2025 GMT, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Food Lion is seeking $1.7 billion in damages from in order to recoup losses from an expose the network aired.</p>
<p>Food Lion, U.S. unit of Belgian retailer Ets Delhaize Freres et Cie &quot;LE LION' SA, claims it lost $1.5 billion in stock value at the time of the November 5, 1992 broadcast, and $233 million in profits after the broadcast.</p>
</text>
